      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive clinicians and supportive team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise the veterinary team for their compassionate and attentive care during both routine examinations and urgent visits. Reviewers frequently note that doctors take time to listen to concerns and address chronic health issues thoroughly. Although two clients mentioned brief or dismissive interactions, the overwhelming majority describe a warm and reassuring clinic staff."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 29,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for injured pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight how gently the veterinary technicians and doctors treat their dogs and cats, even when animals arrive stressed or in pain. Several reviews mention that pets were comforted during emergency evaluations and stayed calm through treatments. Owners appreciate that staff treat their animals with genuine care rather than rushing through procedures."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Prompt assistance during emergency arrivals"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers note that the hospital accepts urgent walk-in cases promptly, taking critical pets to the treatment area without long delays. Pet parents facing emergencies emphasize that fast intake helped stabilize their companions quickly. While one client reported being turned away near closing time, most visitors describe timely attention and manageable wait times."
      }
    }
  ],
